OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mainly cloudy day, and there
OL,6,Fwill be a little patchy rain here and
OL,7,Fthere mainly over southern
OL,8,FAberdeenshire. Some brighter spells
OL,9,Fover Moray and after some early
OL,10,Fmorning rain here it will be mainly
OL,11,Fdry and quite warm. Breezy.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FAberdeenshire mainly cloudy
OL,14,Fthis evening with patchy rain but the
OL,15,Fnorth coast and Moray mainly dry.
OL,16,FOvernight clear spells developing more
OL,17,Fwidely.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
