OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FIt will be a bright day with
OL,6,Fsome sunny spells. A mainly dry
OL,7,Fmorning then a few heavy showers
OL,8,Fdeveloping in the afternoon. Fresh to
OL,9,Fstrong southwest winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FBright
OL,12,Fbut showery on Tuesday with strong
OL,13,Fwinds, coastal gales in north. Showers
OL,14,Fdying out on Wednesday with some sunny
OL,15,Fspells developing. Rain spreading from
OL,16,Fwest on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
